TI  - Successful treatment of invasive pulmonary aspergillosis in an immunocompetent 
      host.
PG  - 393-5
AB  - Immunocompromised individuals are susceptible to pulmonary Aspergillus infection, 
      but invasive Aspergillus infection is extremely rare in the presence of normal 
      immunity. A case of invasive pulmonary aspergillosis in an immunocompetent 
      57-year-old female who was successfully treated with liposomal amphotericin-B is 
      reported here.
