TI  - Paediatric and adult bronchiectasis: Diagnosis, disease burden and prognosis.
PG  - 413-422
LID - 10.1111/resp.13495 [doi]
AB  - Bronchiectasis is a chronic, debilitating disease with increasing worldwide 
      prevalence and burden. Accurate and early diagnosis is essential for both its 
      management and prognosis. This review will discuss the diagnosis of 
      bronchiectasis, the international burden of the disease and its current 
      prognosis.
