TI  - Fire-eater's lung complicated by an infectious abscess requiring surgical 
      treatment.
PG  - 379-81
LID - 10.1111/j.1440-1843.2009.01688.x [doi]
AB  - We describe a case of fire-eater's pneumonia that was complicated by an 
      infectious lung abscess with substantial haemoptysis. Conservative treatment was 
      inadequate. Surgical resection was necessary and proved to be successful.
