TI  - Respirology year-in-review 2006: Basic science.
PG  - 184-90
AB  - The year 2006 was a good year for basic science publications in Respirology with 
      a lot of the studies being relevant to clinical practice. In this respect many of 
      the publications focused on biomarkers of disease and so much so that these have 
      been discussed at the end of this review. The majority of manuscripts are related 
      to airway diseases, respiratory infections, interstitial lung diseases and lung 
      cancers, and are discussed under these headings.
