TI  - Classifying patients by their characteristics and clinical presentations; the use 
      of latent class analysis.
PG  - 1138-48
LID - 10.1111/resp.12408 [doi]
AB  - In this article, we introduce the general statistical analysis approach known as 
      latent class analysis and discuss some of the issues associated with this type of 
      analysis in practice. Two recent examples from the respiratory health literature 
      are used to highlight the types of research questions that have been addressed 
      using this approach.
