TI  - Interventional radiology of pleural diseases.
PG  - 419-29
LID - 10.1111/j.1440-1843.2011.01948.x [doi]
AB  - Image-guided pleural procedures are important in both the diagnosis and 
      management of pleural disease. Pleural aspiration, biopsy and drainage are all 
      proven to be safer and more efficacious using image guidance. The aim of this 
      article is to review common image-guided pleural techniques and the evidence base 
      for their application in clinical practice.
