TI  - Respiratory infections: a current and future threat.
PG  - 651-5
LID - 10.1111/j.1440-1843.2009.01554.x [doi]
AB  - Despite all the medical progress in the last 50 years pulmonary infections 
      continue to exact and extremely high human and economic cost. This review will 
      focus on the human, pathogen and environmental factors that contribute to the 
      continued global burden or respiratory diseases with a particular focus on areas 
      where we might hope to see some progress in the coming decades.
