TI  - Primary lung involvement with amyloid deposition in Waldenstöm's 
      macroglobulinemia: observations from over 20 years.
PG  - 414-8
AB  - Primary lung involvement in Waldenström's macroglobulinemia (WM) is rare. The 
      present case had lymphoplasmacytic lymphoma, secreting monoclonal IgM, localized 
      to the lung.WM is also of great interest with regard to the pathogenesis of 
      amyloidosis. The nodular, parenchymal amyloid lesions of the lung are presented 
      with CXR observations of more than 20 years.
